@cc ___________________________________________
@cc ~ Mode file to load COSPO into a free     ~
@cc ~ segment and start Cosmos spooling.      ~
@cc ~_________________________________________~
@cc
@STOP-SPOOLING COSMOS-SPOOLING
@SET-PERIPHERAL-FILE "COSMOS-SPOOLING",1731B
@Hold 0,0
@Hold 12,2
@Abort COSPO
@Schedule 503b
@RT-loader
CHANGE-RT-DESCRIPTION COSPO,,0,,,,,,,
CLEAR-SEGMENT COSPOOL
SET-PAGE-TABLE 1
NEW-SEGMENT COSPOOL,2,DM,,,,,,,
READ-BINARY (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-COSP-VSX-E02,COSPOOL,,,
END-LOAD
WRITE-SEGMENT COSPOOL,,,,
CHANGE-RT-DESCRIPTION COSPO,,COSPOOL,,,,,,,,
EXIT-LOADER
